sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails<br/>Orchestrator
    participant Istio as Istio Sidecar<br/>mTLS
    participant BuiltIn as Built-in Detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Judge as LLM Judge Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant S3 as S3 / MinIO<br/>9000/TCP HTTP
    participant vLLM as vLLM Server<br/>HTTP
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over S3,HF: Flow 2: HuggingFace Model Loading (startup)
    S3->>HF: KServe storage initializer<br/>downloads model files<br/>AWS credentials auth
    HF->>HF: Auto-detect model type<br/>(sequence/token/causal LM)

    Note over Orchestrator,BuiltIn: Flow 1: Built-in Content Detection
    Orchestrator->>BuiltIn: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>8080/TCP HTTP<br/>Platform auth (mesh)
    BuiltIn->>BuiltIn: Dispatch to registries:<br/>Regex PII / File-type / Custom
    BuiltIn-->>Orchestrator: DetectionResult[]<br/>detection_type, score, evidence

    Note over Orchestrator,HF: Flow 2: HuggingFace Model Inference
    Orchestrator->>Istio: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>8000/TCP
    Istio->>HF: Forward request<br/>mTLS STRICT
    HF->>HF: Tokenize → Model inference<br/>→ Threshold filtering
    HF-->>Istio: DetectionResult[]<br/>label, score, span offsets
    Istio-->>Orchestrator: Response

    Note over Orchestrator,vLLM: Flow 3: LLM Judge Evaluation
    Orchestrator->>Istio: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>or /api/v1/text/generation<br/>8000/TCP
    Istio->>Judge: Forward request<br/>mTLS STRICT
    Judge->>vLLM: LLM evaluation request<br/>via Judge.from_url()<br/>metric: safety (default)
    vLLM-->>Judge: Judgment result<br/>pass/fail + reasoning
    Judge-->>Istio: DetectionResult[]
    Istio-->>Orchestrator: Response

    Note over Prom,BuiltIn: Metrics Collection
    Prom->>BuiltIn: GET /metrics<br/>8080/TCP
    BuiltIn-->>Prom: trustyai_guardrails_*<br/>detections, requests,<br/>errors, runtime
    Prom->>HF: GET /metrics<br/>8000/TCP
    HF-->>Prom: trustyai_guardrails_*
